# wget: BusyBox's own TLS, in the same process. (With the OpenSSL helper,
# wget vforks to run "openssl", and when that fails the child calls exit(),
# not _exit(): without an MMU that is the parent's memory, and musl's exit
# lock then stops the parent with SIGILL.)
# CONFIG_FEATURE_WGET_OPENSSL is not set
